es, coffret 30\u1d49 Anniversaire Pok\u00e9mon"},{"id":93961,"src":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/coffret-pokemon-figurine-mew-30-ans-dos-boutique-nyon.webp","thumbnail":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/coffret-pokemon-figurine-mew-30-ans-dos-boutique-nyon-500x500.webp","srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/coffret-pokemon-figurine-mew-30-ans-dos-boutique-nyon.webp 1200w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/coffret-pokemon-figurine-mew-30-ans-dos-boutique-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/coffret-pokemon-figurine-mew-30-ans-dos-boutique-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/coffret-pokemon-figurine-mew-30-ans-dos-boutique-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/coffret-pokemon-figurine-mew-30-ans-dos-boutique-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/coffret-pokemon-figurine-mew-30-ans-dos-boutique-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/coffret-pokemon-figurine-mew-30-ans-dos-boutique-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/coffret-pokemon-figurine-mew-30-ans-dos-boutique-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/coffret-pokemon-figurine-mew-30-ans-dos-boutique-nyon-64x64.webp 64w","sizes":"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/coffret-pokemon-figurine-mew-30-ans-dos-boutique-nyon-500x500.webp 500w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/coffret-pokemon-figurine-mew-30-ans-dos-boutique-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/coffret-pokemon-figurine-mew-30-ans-dos-boutique-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/coffret-pokemon-figurine-mew-30-ans-dos-boutique-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/coffret-pokemon-figurine-mew-30-ans-dos-boutique-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/coffret-pokemon-figurine-mew-30-ans-dos-boutique-nyon-600x600.webp 600w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/coffret-pokemon-figurine-mew-30-ans-dos-boutique-nyon-100x100.webp 100w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/coffret-pokemon-figurine-mew-30-ans-dos-boutique-nyon-64x64.webp 64w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/coffret-pokemon-figurine-mew-30-ans-dos-boutique-nyon.webp 1200w","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px","name":"Collection avec figurine Mew \u2013 dos","alt":"Dos de la bo\u00eete Collection avec figurine Mew 30\u1d49 Anniversaire Pok\u00e9mon"}],"categories":[{"id":2628,"name":"Coffrets Pok\u00e9mon en Fran\u00e7ais","slug":"coffrets-pokemon-en-francais","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/cartes-a-collectionner\/pokemon-cartes\/cartes-pokemon-en-francais\/coffrets-pokemon-en-francais\/"}],"tags":[{"id":2281,"name":"Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"pokemon","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/etiquette-produit\/pokemon\/"}],"brands":[{"id":6477,"name":"The Pok\u00e9mon Company","slug":"the-pokemon-company","link":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/marque\/the-pokemon-company\/"}],"attributes":[{"id":11,"name":"Licence","taxonomy":"pa_licence","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":6680,"name":"Pok\u00e9mon","slug":"pokemon"}]},{"id":7,"name":"Langue","taxonomy":"pa_langue","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":5361,"name":"Fran\u00e7ais","slug":"francais"}]},{"id":37,"name":"Type de produit TCG","taxonomy":"pa_format-tcg","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12052,"name":"Coffret","slug":"coffret"}]},{"id":38,"name":"Bloc Pok\u00e9mon","taxonomy":"pa_bloc-pokemon","has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":12065,"name":"M\u00e9ga-\u00c9volution","slug":"mega-evolution"}]}],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":false,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":1,"stock_availability":{"text":"Plus que 1 en stock","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"ND","formatted_dimensions":"ND","add_to_cart":{"text":"Lire la suite","description":"En savoir plus sur &ldquo;Coffret Pok\u00e9mon Figurine Mew ME05.5 Celebration 30 Ans&rdquo;","url":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/coffret-pokemon-figurine-mew-me05-5-celebration-30-ans\/","single_text":"Ajouter au panier","minimum":1,"maximum":1,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/93861","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=93861&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":93855,"name":"Tripack Pok\u00e9mon Autocollant R\u00e9ajustable Lucario \/ Noadkoko d&rsquo;Alola ME05.5 Celebration 30 Ans","slug":"tripack-pokemon-autocollant-reajustable-lucario-noadkoko-dalola-me05-5-celebration-30-ans","parent":0,"type":"variable","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/produit\/tripack-pokemon-autocollant-reajustable-lucario-noadkoko-dalola-me05-5-celebration-30-ans\/","sku":"196214144972","short_description":"<p>La <strong>Collection autocollant r\u00e9ajustable Pok\u00e9mon<\/strong> du 30\u1d49 anniversaire r\u00e9unit 3 boosters en fran\u00e7ais, une carte promo brillante et une page d&rsquo;autocollants repositionnables du m\u00eame Pok\u00e9mon.<\/p>\n<p>Deux mod\u00e8les : Lucario, ma\u00eetre de l&rsquo;aura, ou Noadkoko d&rsquo;Alola, dont le cou d\u00e9passe un peu du cadre. On colle, on d\u00e9colle, on recommence.<\/p>","description":"<h2>Collection autocollant r\u00e9ajustable Pok\u00e9mon : trois boosters et un Pok\u00e9mon qui se colle partout<\/h2>\n<p>La <strong>Collection autocollant r\u00e9ajustable Pok\u00e9mon<\/strong> est le petit format de la f\u00eate des 30 ans. Trois boosters de l&rsquo;extension 30\u1d49 Anniversaire, une carte promo brillante et une page d&rsquo;autocollants : de quoi ouvrir, collectionner et d\u00e9corer dans le m\u00eame blister.<\/p>\n<p>Les autocollants sont r\u00e9ajustables, c&rsquo;est-\u00e0-dire qu&rsquo;on peut les d\u00e9coller et les replacer. Utile quand on change d&rsquo;avis sur l&#8217;emplacement id\u00e9al de Lucario, ce qui arrive plus souvent qu&rsquo;on ne l&rsquo;avoue.<\/p>\n<h3>Lucario ou Noadkoko d&rsquo;Alola<\/h3>\n<p>Le blister existe en deux mod\u00e8les, \u00e0 choisir dans le menu d\u00e9roulant :<\/p>\n<p><strong>Lucario<\/strong>, le Pok\u00e9mon Combat et Acier qui lit l&rsquo;aura des \u00eatres vivants. Un favori de longue date, aussi \u00e0 l&rsquo;aise en tournoi qu&rsquo;en illustration.<br \/>\n<strong>Noadkoko d&rsquo;Alola<\/strong>, la forme Plante et Dragon apparue avec les jeux de la septi\u00e8me g\u00e9n\u00e9ration, c\u00e9l\u00e8bre pour un cou si long qu&rsquo;il d\u00e9passe r\u00e9guli\u00e8rement des cadres. Un Pok\u00e9mon qu&rsquo;on n&rsquo;oublie pas, ne serait-ce que pour la hauteur sous plafond qu&rsquo;il r\u00e9clame.<\/p>\n<p>Dans chaque version, la carte promo et la page d&rsquo;autocollants sont consacr\u00e9es au m\u00eame Pok\u00e9mon : pas de m\u00e9lange, chacun garde son th\u00e8me.<\/p>\n<h3>O\u00f9 coller ses autocollants<\/h3>\n<p>Une page d&rsquo;autocollants repositionnables trouve vite preneur : couverture de cahier, bo\u00eete de deck, porte de chambre, cadre de miroir. Comme ils se d\u00e9collent sans arracher, on peut les d\u00e9placer au fil des envies, ou les garder sur leur page d&rsquo;origine pour la collection. Les parents appr\u00e9cieront qu&rsquo;un Lucario puisse quitter le mur du salon sans laisser de trace.<\/p>\n<h3>Ce qu&rsquo;il y a dans les boosters<\/h3>\n<p>Les trois boosters viennent de l&rsquo;extension 30\u1d49 Anniversaire, sortie en septembre 2026 et riche de plus de 150 cartes. Particularit\u00e9 de cette extension : chaque booster contient 5 cartes brillantes, dont une des 30 cartes Pikachu illustr\u00e9es pour l&rsquo;occasion, plus une \u00c9nergie de base brillante. Pas de cartes communes ternes pour faire le volume, tout brille.<\/p>\n<h3>Un format pour commencer ou pour offrir<\/h3>\n<p>Avec trois boosters, ce blister reste un achat l\u00e9ger, parfait pour go\u00fbter \u00e0 l&rsquo;extension sans s&rsquo;engager sur un gros coffret. C&rsquo;est aussi un cadeau facile pour un enfant qui d\u00e9couvre les cartes : la page d&rsquo;autocollants occupe les mains pendant que les boosters occupent les yeux.<\/p>\n<p>Pour ranger la promo et les meilleures cartes tir\u00e9es, un passage par nos <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/categorie-produit\/cartes-a-collectionner\/accessoires-cartes\/portfolios\/\"><strong>portfolios pour cartes<\/strong><\/a> \u00e9vite qu&rsquo;elles finissent gliss\u00e9es dans un livre de classe.<\/p>\n<h3>Les 30 ans, en version de poche<\/h3>\n<p>Tous les produits de l&rsquo;anniversaire partagent le m\u00eame univers graphique et la m\u00eame question imprim\u00e9e au dos : \u00ab Quel est ton pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9 ? \u00bb. Lucario et Noadkoko d&rsquo;Alola ont \u00e9t\u00e9 retenus pour ce format, et chacun a ses partisans. Ceux qui ont connu <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/extension\/celebrations\/\"><strong>l&rsquo;extension C\u00e9l\u00e9brations<\/strong><\/a>, il y a cinq ans, retrouveront le principe d&rsquo;une extension pens\u00e9e pour la f\u00eate plut\u00f4t que pour la comp\u00e9tition.<\/p>\n<div class=\"category-seo-more\">\n<details>\n<summary style=\"cursor:pointer;color:#cc0000\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ffffff\">Lire plus<\/span><\/strong><\/summary>\n<p>Les autocollants se replacent, les cartes aussi, mais un Noadkoko d&rsquo;Alola coll\u00e9 sur un frigo a tendance \u00e0 y rester tr\u00e8s longtemps. Pr\u00e9voir de la place en hauteur.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"2990","regular_price":"2990","sale_price":"2990","price_range":null,"currency_code":"CHF","currency_symbol":"CHF","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":"","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"CHF"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">29,90<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#067;&#072;&#070;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":93955,"src":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/collection-autocollant-reajustable-pokemon-30-ans-lucario-boutique-nyon.webp","thumbnail":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/collection-autocollant-reajustable-pokemon-30-ans-lucario-boutique-nyon-500x500.webp","srcset":"https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/collection-autocollant-reajustable-pokemon-30-ans-lucario-boutique-nyon.webp 1200w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/collection-autocollant-reajustable-pokemon-30-ans-lucario-boutique-nyon-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/collection-autocollant-reajustable-pokemon-30-ans-lucario-boutique-nyon-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/collection-autocollant-reajustable-pokemon-30-ans-lucario-boutique-nyon-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/collection-autocollant-reajustable-pokemon-30-ans-lucario-boutique-nyon-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.bdfancomics.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/c